This licence covers this repository's own code and text only.

Prowlers & Paragons Ultimate Edition is © LakeSide Games. This licence grants
no right to it.

  - data/rules/ holds structured values (costs, ranks, ids) with descriptions
    written for this tool.

  - data/rulebook/ holds the printed text of the book, extracted chapter by
    chapter with the page each section came from. It is here by the author's
    permission, given to this repository's owner for their own table.
    That permission does not travel with a fork: if you have forked this
    repository it is not yours, and you should remove data/rulebook/.

  - data/rulebook/ is not part of the browser payload and the public site does
    not serve it. It is bundled into the server worker and returned only to a
    signed-in caller, one search result at a time with its page citation.

  - Source PDFs are gitignored repository-wide; CI fails if one is ever tracked.

You need your own copy of the rulebook to use any of this.
